{"id":"torrey:human-nature-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Human Nature Of Christ, The","slug":"human-nature-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Was necessary to his mediatorial office — 1Ti 2:5; Heb 2:17; Ga 4:4,5; 1Co 15:21; Ro 6:15,19.","refs":[["1Tim",2,5,2,5],["Heb",2,17,2,17],["Gal",4,4,4,4],["Gal",4,5,4,5],["1Cor",15,21,15,21],["Rom",6,15,6,15],["Rom",6,19,6,19]]},{"text":"Conception in the Virgin’s womb. — Mt 1:18; Lu 1:31.","refs":[["Matt",1,18,1,18],["Luke",1,31,1,31]]},{"text":"Birth. — Mt 1:16,25; 2:2; Lu 2:7,11.","refs":[["Matt",1,16,1,16],["Matt",1,25,1,25],["Matt",2,2,2,2],["Luke",2,7,2,7],["Luke",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Partaking of flesh and blood. — Joh 1:14; Heb 2:14.","refs":[["John",1,14,1,14],["Heb",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Having a human soul. — Mt 26:38; Lu 23:46; Ac 2:31.","refs":[["Matt",26,38,26,38],["Luke",23,46,23,46],["Acts",2,31,2,31]]},{"text":"Circumcision. — Lu 2:21.","refs":[["Luke",2,21,2,21]]},{"text":"Increase in wisdom and stature. — Lu 2:52.","refs":[["Luke",2,52,2,52]]},{"text":"Weeping. — Lu 19:41; Joh 11:35.","refs":[["Luke",19,41,19,41],["John",11,35,11,35]]},{"text":"Hungering. — Mt 4:2; 21:18.","refs":[["Matt",4,2,4,2],["Matt",21,18,21,18]]},{"text":"Thirsting. — Joh 4:7; 19:28.","refs":[["John",4,7,4,7],["John",19,28,19,28]]},{"text":"Sleeping. — Mt 8:24; Mr 4:38.","refs":[["Matt",8,24,8,24],["Mark",4,38,4,38]]},{"text":"Being subject to weariness. — Joh 4:6.","refs":[["John",4,6,4,6]]},{"text":"Being a man of sorrows. — Isa 53:3,4; Lu 22:44; Joh 11:33; 12:27.","refs":[["Isa",53,3,53,3],["Isa",53,4,53,4],["Luke",22,44,22,44],["John",11,33,11,33],["John",12,27,12,27]]},{"text":"Being buffeted. — Mt 26:67; Lu 22:64.","refs":[["Matt",26,67,26,67],["Luke",22,64,22,64]]},{"text":"Enduring indignities. — Lu 23:11.","refs":[["Luke",23,11,23,11]]},{"text":"Being scourged. — Mt 27:26; Lu 22:64.","refs":[["Matt",27,26,27,26],["Luke",22,64,22,64]]},{"text":"Being nailed to the cross. — Ps 22:16; Lu 23:33.","refs":[["Ps",22,16,22,16],["Luke",23,33,23,33]]},{"text":"Death. — Joh 19:30.","refs":[["John",19,30,19,30]]},{"text":"Side being pierced. — Joh 19:34.","refs":[["John",19,34,19,34]]},{"text":"Burial. — Mt 27:59,60; Mr 15:46.","refs":[["Matt",27,59,27,59],["Matt",27,60,27,60],["Mark",15,46,15,46]]},{"text":"Resurrection. — Ac 3:15; 2Ti 2:8.","refs":[["Acts",3,15,3,15],["2Tim",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Was like our own in all things except sin — Ac 3:22; Php 2:7,8; Heb 2:17.","refs":[["Acts",3,22,3,22],["Phil",2,7,2,7],["Phil",2,8,2,8],["Heb",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Was without sin — Heb 7:26,28; 1Jo 3:5; 1Pe 2:22; Heb 4:15; Joh 18:38; 8:46.","refs":[["Heb",7,26,7,26],["Heb",7,28,7,28],["1John",3,5,3,5],["1Pet",2,22,2,22],["Heb",4,15,4,15],["John",18,38,18,38],["John",8,46,8,46]]},{"text":"Was submitted to the evidence of the senses — Lu 24:39; Joh 20:27; 1Jo 1:1,2.","refs":[["Luke",24,39,24,39],["John",20,27,20,27],["1John",1,1,1,1],["1John",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"The woman. — Ge 3:15; Isa 7:4; Jer 31:22; Lu 1:31; Ga 4:4.","refs":[["Gen",3,15,3,15],["Isa",7,4,7,4],["Jer",31,22,31,22],["Luke",1,31,1,31],["Gal",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Abraham. — Ge 22:18; Ga 3:16; Heb 2:16.","refs":[["Gen",22,18,22,18],["Gal",3,16,3,16],["Heb",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"David. — 2Sa 7:12,16; Ps 89:35,36; Jer 23:5; Mt 22:42; Mr 10:47; Ac 2:30; 13:23; Ro 1:3.","refs":[["2Sam",7,12,7,12],["2Sam",7,16,7,16],["Ps",89,35,89,35],["Ps",89,36,89,36],["Jer",23,5,23,5],["Matt",22,42,22,42],["Mark",10,47,10,47],["Acts",2,30,2,30],["Acts",13,23,13,23],["Rom",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Genealogy of — Mt 1:1-17; Lu 3:23-38.","refs":[["Matt",1,1,1,17],["Luke",3,23,3,38]]},{"text":"Attested by himself — Mt 8:20; 16:13.","refs":[["Matt",8,20,8,20],["Matt",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Confession of, a test of belonging to God — Joh 4:2.","refs":[["John",4,2,4,2]]},{"text":"Acknowledged by men — Mr 6:3; Joh 7:27; 19:5; Ac 2:22.","refs":[["Mark",6,3,6,3],["John",7,27,7,27],["John",19,5,19,5],["Acts",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Denied by Antichrist — 1Jo 4:3; 2Jo 1:7.","refs":[["1John",4,3,4,3],["2John",1,7,1,7]]}],"refCount":93}
